 "description": "Curved bridge under torsion from the CAD 2023 paper with 10 hangers: a compression bottom chord (-5) and a tension top chord (+5) split by a middle deviation edge into two trails each, vertical compression hangers (-0.1), tension ties (+1.5) and compression deck struts (-1.5) as deviation edges; the deck nodes carry a uniform downward line load and get auxiliary trails along +z. Supports at both ends of both chords. Optimisation: TrailEdgeForceGoal(0) on the auxiliary trails and LineGoal pulling the four chord-end supports onto vertical target lines; parameters = all deviation forces (+-10) and the lengths of the trail edges at the supports (+-0.5); nlopt SLSQP, 100 evals, stopval 1e-6.",
